WEBVTT

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:07.380
What?

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:09.460
Oh, it's Saturday.

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:12.260
Just a few more minutes...

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:20.140
The school festival preparations!

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:22.350
Oh crap, I'm late!

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:29.030
That stings!

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:21.350
The School Festival...

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:26.140
My first big event as the
chairperson of the school.

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:32.150
Just one more day.
I need to get through this.

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:41.870
I don't know why but I'm so excited,
I feel "moe" burning inside me!

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:44.410
Oh, "moé" cute, oni.

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:46.500
Hey, you got the "moe" wrong.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:48.500
It should be "fire" as in burning,
and not "cute".

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:50.630
We'll let that slide.

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:54.460
But these "Moero Oore" energy drinks
are really effective!

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:57.720
I can't believe
how fired up Miss Ruri is.

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:02.350
Fired up?
Then now may be a good time.

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:04.560
Miss Ruri.

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:08.390
No, no Kagami. You're too close.

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:11.940
And you're even taking a chance
on holding her hand.

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:13.570
What are you two doing?

00:03:13.570 --> 00:03:14.730
How disrespectful!

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:18.240
What are you thinking,
barging in and taking pictures?

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:20.280
I asked them to.

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:25.950
I asked them to take pictures
to commemorate the festival.

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:26.870
Right?

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:31.580
Just a little more to the left, left.

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:32.880
Right there!

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:38.760
OK, as the new chairperson of the academy,
do you have any comments about tomorrow's festival?

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:39.760
Go.

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:43.510
I'm your new chairperson,
Ruri Aiba.

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:50.480
This will be my first festival as chairperson and,
with your help, I look forward to making this one the best ever.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:57.530
That's what you think,
squid face, oni!

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:03.530
I told you not to
speak in public.

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:05.450
We have an emergency situation, oni.

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:08.620
There's a Dark Stone nearby, oni.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:09.790
On campus?

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:11.620
Yes, oni.

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:18.840
Man, I'm bored.
I just want to go home.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:23.800
You know, our GPA is so bad,
we gotta earn credit by doing this.

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:25.760
Hey, I'm not in the
same boat as you.

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:27.010
Yeah, you are.

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:28.350
No, I'm not.

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:29.470
Idiot!

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:33.650
Hey, isn't that Tandoji?

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:35.270
Yeah, it is.

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:37.820
Man, what a buzz kill.

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:41.320
Why does he need to come
to the festival?

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:43.990
He should just quit school.

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:46.780
You're right!

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.750
<i>Hello, this is Kagami.</i>

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:55.750
How is the situation there?

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:57.920
I apologize about what happened earlier.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.550
I took Oni-gawara aside,

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:03.550
and made sure he understood that
he should never do such a thing again.

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:04.840
<i>I understand.</i>

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:07.510
Well.

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:09.680
What is the target?

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:13.020
It's a weakling that
even I can take down, oni.

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:26.070
You get to be...

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:27.030
here!

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:30.490
Tomorrow is your day to shine!

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:31.830
Do your best!

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:35.460
Sorry.

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:38.040
Don't worry, I'll fix it later.

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:44.090
Wow, it must be nice
to be so tall.

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:47.050
There's nothing nice about it.

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:49.890
I constantly hit my head
on the door frame.

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:51.100
Really?

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:53.060
I didn't know.

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:54.850
Must be rough!

00:05:55.810 --> 00:05:57.060
Does it still hurt?

00:05:57.060 --> 00:05:57.810
No...

00:05:57.810 --> 00:05:58.770
You OK?

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:00.900
Looks like preparations
are on track.

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:04.740
Ruri! Thanks for letting us
use the projector.

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:08.660
Now we can showcase
our treasured video.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:11.580
Thank you so much!

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:16.370
Tomorrow, we're going to rock the festival!

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:17.040
Yeah!

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:31.600
I'm going out.

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:32.970
OK!

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:35.520
You OK?

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:36.100
What happened?

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:37.940
Ouch!

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:38.850
What happened?

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:42.940
I kicked that soccer ball
and it turned into a rock.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:43.940
A rock?

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:45.740
What the heck is going on?

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:49.950
We've got a Dark Stone
on our hands.

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:51.660
I told you so, oni.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:53.030
As I suspected.

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:56.120
Hey, Tandoji.

00:06:58.460 --> 00:06:59.750
Come with me.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.040
Alright.

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:09.130
If she finds out there's
a Dark Stone loose on campus,

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:12.890
Miss Ruri will cancel the festival.

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:18.810
If Oni-gawara's data is correct,
I can handle the situation by myself

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:22.150
No matter how weak,
a Dark Stone will always be a Dark Stone, oni.

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:23.730
I have a plan.

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:24.820
Oni?

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:30.820
Whatever happens,
do not tell Miss Ruri about the Dark Stone.

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:37.660
Well?

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:40.000
Going back to the club?

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:41.540
I'm thinking.

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:42.670
Oni?

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:46.210
I have to agree,
it was a weak sensation.

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:48.670
It might evolve, though.

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:50.050
Yes, oni.

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:54.850
If that's the case, I'll use the Sacred power
so we're certain to defeat it.

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:57.060
You'll have to ask Ruri, oni.

00:07:57.810 --> 00:08:01.600
You have to ask her to transform you
to defeat the Dark Stone, oni.

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:04.860
But then that'll mean the end
of our festival, oni.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:08.030
Yeah, you're right.

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:16.700
<i>Tomorrow we're going to rock the festival!</i>

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.750
You can use a little trick, oni.

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:22.710
You want me to deceive her?

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:24.830
Just a little performance, oni.

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:28.760
You see, you should stare ever intently
into her eyes and say to her, oni.

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:35.600
Your bright, shiny eyes, just like freshly-baked roof tiles,
fire me up to fight for you, oni!

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:39.060
Ruri, I'm so sorry.

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:41.940
I know you shouldn't be doing this,
being the chairperson and all.

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:43.520
Don't mind me.

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:46.520
I actually enjoy
this type of work.

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:51.740
Chairperson's office?

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:54.740
<i>Hello, Kagami?
Have you completed the inspection?</i>

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:57.990
Um, this is Alma.

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:02.960
Oh, um, it's you Alma?

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:04.750
Alma?

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:06.000
<i>Sorry to ask but--</i>

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:07.880
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:09.920
It's just some balloons popping.

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:11.260
<i>Again?</i>

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:13.050
Um, what were you saying?

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:16.720
<i>Y-Yeah, I have something I need to talk to you about.</i>

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:19.100
<i>C-Can you meet me on the rooftop?</i>

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:23.810
<i>What?</i>

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:25.770
My chest, it's burning.

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:27.150
<i>Ch-Chest?</i>

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:28.770
<i>You OK?</i>

00:09:29.190 --> 00:09:32.150
<i>Yes. Perfectly fine.
I'm heading right over.</i>

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:33.700
OK then.

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:42.950
<i>We've located a Dark Stone inside the academy. Initiate emergency formation.</i>

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.660
Yes sir.

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:48.670
Activate the motion detector
and thermal detector.

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:49.960
<i>Yes sir.</i>

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:55.880
All sensors reporting
normal readings.

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.260
Sending out data.

00:09:57.800 --> 00:10:01.140
<i>Sync the results of the thermal analysis with the motion detector.</i>

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:02.140
Yes sir.

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:06.690
Oh, I see.

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:08.980
The Dark Stone can't be
detected by heat.

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:09.940
<i>In addition,</i>

00:10:10.190 --> 00:10:13.690
<i>get the Engagement Suit immediately to the academy.</i>

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:15.860
But won't the students see?

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:16.950
<i>Not a problem.</i>

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:22.080
We have Operation Mirror Force,
just for this situation.

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:25.160
Operation Mirror Force?

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:28.960
Now, don't report this to Miss Ruri.

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:32.170
Um...

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:36.340
You wanted to
ask me something?

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:38.800
Uh, well.

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:41.640
Hey!

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:43.890
Yes?

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:50.860
I... want to learn how to use
my Sacred powers better.

00:10:51.270 --> 00:10:56.070
I want to use this power
to help you, I mean us.

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:57.400
I agree!

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:59.200
That's great!

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:02.370
How about... transforming me
right now?

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:04.330
What?

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:10.670
Just to test it out and
I can help support everyone.

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:12.000
Well...

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:13.710
Your...

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.090
...bright...

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:16.840
...shiny...

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:18.760
...eyes...

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:22.350
I can't do it!

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:23.850
Forget what I just said!

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:25.390
Please, wait.

00:11:30.810 --> 00:11:33.400
Well if it's only for training,
how about using the spare.

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:35.280
Y-Yeah, that's a good idea.

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:36.900
So...

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:39.900
About that spare,
how much does it cost?

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:44.080
I seem to recall about...
1.4 hundred million $.

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:45.290
One hundred million!

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:47.910
That's 40 million yen, oni.

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:48.910
Whoa...

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:53.130
Your memories I take into me.

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:57.760
My Soul...

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:01.430
I give to you.

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:08.220
That's good for now.

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:09.850
Excuse me.

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:16.110
U-Um...

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:20.860
Is that you...

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:24.950
Tan... do... ji?

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:47.470
Um... is that you...

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:50.390
Tandoji?

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:53.690
Yeah, club leader,
there's a reason for this. Um...

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:57.360
Oh, it's OK.
Great costume Tandoji!

00:12:57.360 --> 00:12:58.360
Huh?

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:03.320
Well, the advertisement for the club
has been driving me nuts.

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:07.370
But with an outfit like that,
we're sure to make an impact!

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:08.700
Right, Ruri?

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:11.410
Yeah, it probably would.

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:13.080
Advertisement?

00:13:13.210 --> 00:13:14.370
Here you go.

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:31.640
Operation Mirror Force, begin!

00:13:34.190 --> 00:13:36.560
OK, let's do this!

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:38.980
You're in a good mood, oni.

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:41.690
Well, yes.
Alma finally got serious.

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:47.160
She doesn't suspect that
I'm the one pulling the strings, oni.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:51.120
Aw, crud!

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:53.450
Geez, it's fast.

00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:57.540
Tandoji?

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.250
Have you transformed?

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:03.720
<i>Miss Ruri reported that the transformation was for training.</i>

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:05.380
Aw, geez.

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:17.350
Oh my cheeks, such pain.

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:26.950
Hey, come back and apologize.

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:28.030
Oops.

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:31.200
Excuse me. Goodbye.

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:33.620
Hold on!

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:35.410
Kagami!

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:46.590
What?

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:47.770
Tandoji?

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:48.550
There's more.

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:49.620
What is he supposed to be?

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:51.090
OK, over here for now!

00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:54.310
There are two targets now?

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:56.770
<i>It appears the Dark Stone has split into two.</i>

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:58.690
More trouble.

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:01.560
Kagami, what are you doing?

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:05.110
Wow, these are made really well.

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:10.450
Ladies, I apologize but I can't stop to talk
as I'm still working.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:13.450
Could you please return
to the club room?

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:14.580
Great.

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:20.710
Being shut down like that makes me
want to follow him even more.

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:22.170
I know.

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:30.640
We won't make it
unless we hurry.

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:32.550
What?

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:35.720
Is that Tandoji?

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:38.520
What kind of costume is that?

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:39.810
Where is it?

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:42.440
Strike!

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:44.150
Me too.

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:45.320
Go!

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:53.280
Help!

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:00.710
Alright.

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:02.330
That should be enough.

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:10.340
What's going on?

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:12.640
There was an accident
while working on the monument.

00:16:15.560 --> 00:16:17.180
Can't you get down?

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:18.390
No, it's impossible!

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:20.430
Help, hurry!

00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:22.150
Oh no!

00:16:22.150 --> 00:16:24.190
Watch out, don't fall.

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:27.110
You guys are friends, aren't you?

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:29.190
Why didn't you help him?

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:31.280
I gotta do something.

00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:35.370
But I can't use the Sacred power
in front of everyone.

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:37.200
No!

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:45.170
OK.

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:46.170
Got it.

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:47.420
Next!

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:51.590
Tandoji, what are you doing?

00:16:54.720 --> 00:16:55.720
You can do it!

00:16:55.720 --> 00:16:57.640
The rescue squad will
be here any second!

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:59.560
- Whatever you do, don't let go!

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:01.160
I can't hold on any longer.

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:39.850
Students!

00:17:40.310 --> 00:17:43.480
Do not worry. Anything is possible
when there's a hero.

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:51.650
Hey, are you OK?

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:54.700
Thanks, Tandoji.

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:58.530
Thank you so much.

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:01.700
Can you stand?

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:13.260
You know, it seems like Tandoji
is more reliable than we are.

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:14.510
I know.

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:15.800
I think so, too.

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:53.500
Don't scare me like that.

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:06.810
What?

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:09.400
This can't be!

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:12.400
Tandoji, bring the Dark Stone
this way.

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:13.360
Gotcha.

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:27.620
Self-detonation?

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:40.930
All done.

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:52.650
Bring it on, no matter what it is.
We heroes will take care of it.

00:19:52.650 --> 00:19:53.770
Cut!

00:19:54.650 --> 00:19:57.440
OK, that's a wrap!

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:00.320
Oh, they're shooting a movie.

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:03.530
Great work.

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:05.580
I leave the rest to you.

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:06.910
Yes sir.

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:12.080
Operation Mirror Force,
Mission Complete.

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:17.590
Why didn't you tell me first?

00:20:17.590 --> 00:20:19.380
What were you thinking?

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:21.630
Care to explain, Kagami?

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:24.760
We prioritized the removal
of the Dark Stone.

00:20:25.010 --> 00:20:27.720
Fortunately the situation
was contained,

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:31.480
but did it not occur to you the students'
safety would be jeopardized?

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:32.810
This was all for you--

00:20:32.810 --> 00:20:34.610
Don't say anything.

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:36.110
For me?

00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:37.570
Yes.

00:20:37.650 --> 00:20:41.700
He didn't want to have the festival
you were looking forward to be ruined.

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:44.450
Tandoji! You didn't either!

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:46.780
I understand.

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:55.460
Both of you. From now on, do not go against
a Dark Stone without telling me.

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:57.500
Please.

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:58.920
I'm sorry.

00:21:00.090 --> 00:21:04.800
But, I'm so grateful that you maintained
the safety of the festival.

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:06.680
Thank you so much.

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:09.930
Um, if you'd like, please,

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:11.730
...have some.

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:15.980
Alright, I was on the brink of starvation.

00:21:16.150 --> 00:21:17.690
Can I eat all of it?

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:21.820
Leave some for me.

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:31.500
With the great weather, we had a tremendous
number of visitors to the festival.

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:36.960
The stone club placed second
among the liberal-art clubs.

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:43.050
It was disappointing that my favorite documentary,
"24 hours of stones" had less-than-stellar feedback.

00:21:43.050 --> 00:21:45.180
I don't get it,
they're so cute!

00:21:45.590 --> 00:21:50.060
OK, Kagami move over to your left. Left!

00:21:50.060 --> 00:21:55.520
Oh yeah, Tandoji and Kagami
were awarded for their efforts.

00:21:55.980 --> 00:21:58.810
Special award for best costume-play!

00:22:03.110 --> 00:22:05.860
Ah, it's almost over.

00:22:05.860 --> 00:22:07.870
I can't believe it.

00:22:08.200 --> 00:22:09.030
Huh?

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:12.040
Those are selling really well.

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:13.540
How do you know?

00:22:13.540 --> 00:22:15.870
My family operates
a drug store.

00:22:15.870 --> 00:22:18.000
They're that good?

00:22:19.040 --> 00:22:20.880
These drinks are...

00:22:28.220 --> 00:22:30.640
Is something wrong,
Miss Ruri?

00:22:30.640 --> 00:22:32.060
No, nothing!

00:22:32.640 --> 00:22:34.230
But you're blushing.

00:22:34.640 --> 00:22:35.810
Bright red.

00:22:36.060 --> 00:22:38.060
Alma! I'm so...

00:22:38.560 --> 00:22:39.810
...embarrassed!
